SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_MediumRebeccaIntro::
	.string "The power of all those you defeated\n"
	.string "comes to me!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_MediumRebeccaDefeat::
	.string "Strong...\n"
	.string "Far too strong...$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_MediumRebecca::
	.string "What is the source of your power?$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_PsychicJaredIntro::
	.string "The FIGHTING DOJO next door was\n"
	.string "once this city’s GYM.$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_PsychicJaredDefeat::
	.string "I was no match...$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_PsychicJared::
	.string "KARATE KING, the master of the\n"
	.string "FIGHTING DOJO, was just destroyed\l"
	.string "by SABRINA.$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_MediumDorisIntro::
	.string "Fufufufu...\n"
	.string "I see it clearly.\p"
	.string "I can see into your soul!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_MediumDorisDefeat::
	.string "Though I read you, I still lost...$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_MediumDoris::
	.string "Darn! I forgot that I predicted\n"
	.string "I would lose to you.$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_PsychicFranklinIntro::
	.string "Psychic power is the power of your\n"
	.string "soul.$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_PsychicFranklinDefeat::
	.string "Your soul has more power than mine!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_PsychicFranklin::
	.string "You made your soul stronger, not just\n"
	.string "your abilities.$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderSabrinaIntro::
	.string "SABRINA: I knew you were coming...\p"
	.string "Three years ago I had a vision of\n"
	.string "your arrival.\p"
	.string "You’re after my BADGE.\p"
	.string "I don’t enjoy battling, but it’s my\n"
	.string "duty as a LEADER to confer BADGES\l"
	.string "on anyone who has proven him- or\l"
	.string "herself worthy.\p"
	.string "Since you wish it, I will show you my\n"
	.string "psychic powers!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderSabrinaDefeat::
	.string "SABRINA: Your power...\p"
	.string "It far exceeds what I foresaw...\p"
	.string "Maybe it isn’t possible to fully\n"
	.string "predict what the future holds...\p"
	.string "OK, you win. You earned yourself\n"
	.string "MARSHBADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the MARSHBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderSabrina_1::
	.string "SABRINA: Your love for your POKéMON\n"
	.string "overwhelmed my psychic power...\p"
	.string "The power of love, I think, is also a\n"
	.string "kind of psychic power...$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderSabrina_2::
	.string "SABRINA: MARSHBADGE draws out\n"
	.string "your subliminal powers...\p"
	.string "Although I failed to accurately\n"
	.string "predict your power, this much I\l"
	.string "know to be true.\p"
	.string "You will become a celebrated and\n"
	.string "beloved CHAMPION!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_LeaderSabrina_3::
	.string "SABRINA: Wait {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I can also sense something else.\p"
	.string "You will soon face a terrible\n"
	.string "danger.\p"
	.string "Please, you must be careful...$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "Yo, CHAMP in making!\p"
	.string "A trainer as skilled as you\n"
	.string "doesn’t need to be told how to deal\l"
	.string "with psychic-type POKéMON, right?\p"
	.string "I expect great things from you!\n"
	.string "Good luck!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "That was another fantastic battle!$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "SAFFRON CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: SABRINA\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS$"

SaffronCity_Interior5_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "SAFFRON CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: SABRINA\p"
	.string "WINNING TRAINERS: CARLOS {PLAYER}$"
